@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084

### Version
GET {{baseUrl}}/version

### List instruments
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instrument

### List instruments for account
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instrument?accountId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get account balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/balance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Deposit money
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/balance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000
}

### Withdraw money
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/balance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100
}

### Get trades for account
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Buy instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "amount": 10
}

### Sell instrument
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "amount": 10
}

### Long buy
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/long/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "amount": 5,
  "duration": 24,
  "price": 125.5
}

### Long sell
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/long/sell
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "amount": 5,
  "duration": 24,
  "price": 125.5
}

### Process long trades
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/trade/long/process

### Get portfolio insights
# Portfolio Insights demo feature: simulated data, not financial advice.
# The flag portfolio-insights-enabled is off by default. Enable it first with the PUT request in ../feature-flag-service/feature-flag-service.http
# While the flag is off or unreadable, every request below answers 403 with {"error":"feature_disabled"}.
# Statuses and error bodies: README.md#portfolio-insights-and-alerts
# Walkthrough, variables (ENABLE_PORTFOLIO_INSIGHTS, ALERT_EVALUATION_INTERVAL_SECONDS, PORTFOLIO_INSIGHTS_ALERT_WEIGHT) and the database recreate note: ../../README.md#portfolio-insights-demo-feature
# Replace the all-zero account id with a real account, and the all-zero alert id with the id from the create response.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/portfolio/insights/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create alert
# type: TARGET_PRICE or PROFIT_LOSS (threshold is a percentage, needs a held instrument); direction: ABOVE or BELOW; threshold: a plain JSON number with at most 10 integer and 8 fractional digits; the seeded instrument c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001 exists in both database seeds.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "type": "TARGET_PRICE",
  "instrumentId": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "direction": "ABOVE",
  "threshold": 150.5
}

### List alerts for account
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts?accountId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List unacknowledged notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/notifications?accountId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&unacknowledged=true

### Acknowledge notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/acknowledge

### Re-arm alert
# {"enabled": false} disables the alert instead; true clears the trigger and increments armingRevision.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Delete alert
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/alerts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
